# Website (Next.js) settings. Local: copy to .env.local.
# GitHub Pages build: add a repository variable TRYON_SPACE
# (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables); the deploy workflow passes it through.

# Which Hugging Face Space makes the try-on picture. Leave empty to use the official
# fashn-ai/fashn-vton-1.5 Space. Put your own here once you've uploaded hf-space/ (needs HF PRO).
NEXT_PUBLIC_TRYON_SPACE=
